            "advisory": "Affected versions of the `pytest` package are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS) due to insecure temporary directory handling. The `tmpdir` fixture relies on directories with the `/tmp/pytest-of-{user}` name pattern, which can be predictably created and manipulated by local users. An attacker can exploit this by pre-creating these directories with restrictive permissions or malicious content, potentially causing test failures or privilege escalation when the tests are executed.",
